      "source_text": "asset samplerBars {\n  size 32x24\n  output point checks\n  output point direction\n  output point samples\n  output point state\n  draw {\n    first=10 to 15 with gaussian(12,2)\n    middle=10 to 15 with gaussian(12,2)\n    last=10 to 15 with gaussian(12,2)\n    tint=#343a42 to #929ca8\n    direction={3,4} to {18,2} with beta(2,3)\n    checks={3,40}\n    samples={first,last}\n    rect(2,2,first,4,tint)\n    rect(2,8,middle,4,tint)\n    rect(2,14,last,4,tint)\n    state={seed&65535,seed>>16}\n  }\n}\n"
